# DeepDose product shell (set in stone)

Product routes (`/grid`, `/dose`, `/bank`, `/profile`, `/account`, `/dosage`, `/connect`, `/chat`):

**North star:** dosers log Light / Meds / Move, raise sleep score, sync on the Grid.

Consumer tribe = **Dosers**. Company / clinical layer = **Deepdose** (Chemistry, TipTraQ, Chronobiobank).

Consumer score language = **sleep score** (“how locked your nights are”). Do not lead UI with SRI — keep SRI for engine / clinical only.

Consumer dose tags = **#Light / #Meds / #Move** (engine ids stay PHOTONIC / METABOLIC / KINETIC).

## Bottom nav (4 tabs)

| Tab | Route | Role |
|---|---|---|
| Grid | `/grid` | Chronotype feed (Larks / Owls) |
| Log | `/dose` | #Light / #Meds / #Move camera |
| Bank | `/bank` | Sleep score gauge + PMK timeline + research opt-in |
| Me | `/profile` | Identity, dose archive, wallet stubs |

Chat / Friends / Chemistry are secondary (linked from Me / Bank). How it works: `/how`.

## Visual system

**OpenAI grid is the source of truth.** Realme supplies flat feed/card *shapes*, not a second token set.

| Layer | Tokens |
|---|---|
| Spacing | `--dd-inset`, `--dd-gap`, `--dd-stack` (4px scale) |
| Ink / surface / border | `--dd-ink*`, `--dd-surface*`, `--dd-border*` |
| Accent | `--dd-accent` (yellow), `--dd-cue-metabolic`, `--dd-cue-kinetic` |
| Radius | `--dd-radius` (8px), `--dd-radius-sm` (4px) |
| Type | `--dd-type-xs` … `--dd-type-xl` (Inter only) |

Defined in `deepdose-product-space.css`. Feature CSS (`deepdose-realme.css`) must use these — **no raw hex / rem litter.**

## Copy

- No waffle. Titles live in `AppTopBar` only.
- Dose cards: sleep score badge (`Score 84`) + Sync (not Likes). Premium: frosted blur + unlock stub.
- Log Dose: photo only — **no captions** (except #Meds → Chemistry).
- Consumer score = **sleep score** / “how locked your nights are”. Never lead with SRI in product chrome.
- Dose tags in UI: **#Light / #Meds / #Move** — never Photonic / Metabolic / Kinetic in chrome.

## Sleep score (engine: SRI)

- Use `@/lib/circadian/sri-engine` (`computeScheduleSri` / matrix rolling). Functional from day 1.
- UI labels from `@/lib/brand/sleep-score`. Do not invent a second formula in UI components.

## Meds = medical

- `#Meds` on Log Dose opens **Chemistry** (`/dosage?from=metabolic`) — meds & timing.
- Optional “Stamp photo for Grid” stays on Log Dose; Chemistry shows a bridge CTA back to stamp.
- TipTraQ testkit (`/testkit`) is linked from Bank Clinical and Me.

## Hard rules

1. `ProductAppShell` + `AppTopBar` + `AppBottomNav` only.
2. Default post-auth landing: `/grid`.
3. Legacy `/real` → `/grid`, `/real/post` → `/dose`.

## Out of scope

- Clinical / enterprise portals
- Full adult payment + CDN DRM (follow-up)
